**New evidence**
SOURCE_CLAIM_JSON: {"title":"Full speech by Party leader Nguyen Phu Trong at National Foreign Relations Conference","publisher":"Government News","publication_date":"2021-12-31","url":"https://en.baochinhphu.vn/full-speech-by-party-leader-nguyen-phu-trong-at-national-foreign-relations-conference-11143010.htm","claim":"Trong said personnel work is 'the root of all things' and that diplomatic staff must be trained in knowledge, capacity, and political mettle, with tighter coordination across ministries and localities.","locator":"lines 279-284","source_type":"official","source_confidence":"high","source_confidence_reason":"Direct official transcript in Trọng's own voice, with explicit program, coordination, and personnel statements.","final_evidence_use":"final_evidence","period_fit":"Antecedent program statement that shaped 2022 execution.","ruler_attribution":"Direct. This is Trọng stating his own priorities for apparatus, coordination, and personnel quality.","contrary_evidence":["It is a self-described program, not proof of execution.","It reflects diplomacy and personnel priorities rather than final outcomes."],"lenses":["8B.1","8B.3","8B.4","8B.5","8B.9"]}
SOURCE_CLAIM_JSON: {"title":"Tổng Bí thư Nguyễn Phú Trọng trả lời phỏng vấn nhân dịp Năm Mới 2022","publisher":"Government of Viet Nam (Báo Điện tử Chính phủ)","publication_date":"2022-01-01","url":"https://baochinhphu.vn/tong-bi-thu-nguyen-phu-trong-tra-loi-phong-van-nhan-dip-nam-moi-2022-102306496.htm","claim":"Trọng said the 13th Party Congress resolution had to be turned into reality through serious, decisive, systematic implementation, with cadres and leaders acting as examples and with concrete action plans rather than formalism.","locator":"lines 187-192","source_type":"official","source_confidence":"high","source_confidence_reason":"Direct 2022 interview transcript published by the government portal; strong for stated program and implementation posture.","final_evidence_use":"final_evidence","period_fit":"Directly in 2022.","ruler_attribution":"Direct statement by Trọng about his own implementation priorities.","contrary_evidence":["The interview is programmatic rhetoric, not a delivery audit.","It shows intended method more than measured success."],"lenses":["8B.1","8B.2","8B.6","8B.8","8B.10"]}
SOURCE_CLAIM_JSON: {"title":"Resolution 43/2022/QH15 on fiscal and monetary policies supporting socio-economic recovery and development program","publisher":"LuatVietnam","publication_date":"2022-01-11","url":"https://english.luatvietnam.vn/resolution-no-43-2022-qh15-dated-january-11-2022-of-the-national-assembly-on-fiscal-and-monetary-policies-supporting-socio-economic-recovery-and-dev-215952-doc1.html","claim":"The Resolution directed large-scale recovery spending, including VND 176 trillion for grassroots health and hospitals, VND 5 trillion in preferential loans, VND 3.15 trillion for vocational and social support facilities, VND 113.5 trillion for infrastructure, and VND 46 trillion for vaccines, drugs, and medical supplies.","locator":"Article 5, fiscal-package passages and Articles 1 and 6","source_type":"legal","source_confidence":"high","source_confidence_reason":"Official legal text with specific amounts, instruments, and implementation responsibilities.","final_evidence_use":"final_evidence","period_fit":"Directly in 2022.","ruler_attribution":"Indirect but material. It is National Assembly action inside the party-state under Trọng's leadership, not a personal order attributable to him alone.","contrary_evidence":["This is an allocation plan, not proof of delivery.","Implementation depended on ministries and local authorities."],"lenses":["8B.2","8B.6","8B.7"]}
SOURCE_CLAIM_JSON: {"title":"Socio-economic development plan for 2022","publisher":"Government of Viet Nam","publication_date":"2021-11-12","url":"https://vietnam.gov.vn/socio-economic-development-plans/socio-economic-development-plan-for-2022-12067464","claim":"The 2022 national plan set goals to protect health and life, support people and businesses, maintain macroeconomic stability, build digital government, strengthen anti-corruption, and pursue specific targets including poverty reduction, 92% health insurance coverage, and 9.4 doctors per 10,000 people.","locator":"lines 115-119, 135-143, 153-161, 202-206","source_type":"official","source_confidence":"high","source_confidence_reason":"Official national plan with explicit objectives, numerical targets, and administrative instructions.","final_evidence_use":"final_evidence","period_fit":"Directly governs 2022 implementation.","ruler_attribution":"Indirect but strong. The plan reflects the state program Trọng was helping steer, though it is not a single-person command document.","contrary_evidence":["The plan mixes goals and directives; it does not itself prove execution.","Some targets were harder to meet than the plan anticipated."],"lenses":["8B.1","8B.2","8B.6","8B.7","8B.8"]}
SOURCE_CLAIM_JSON: {"title":"Government's regular meeting - October 2022","publisher":"Government of Viet Nam (Government News)","publication_date":"2023-01-31","url":"https://en.baochinhphu.vn/governments-regular-meeting-october-2022-11123013120195868.htm","claim":"The government said public-investment disbursement and some Recovery Program policies still had not met requirements, with shortages of drugs and medical supplies and other implementation problems remaining in late 2022.","locator":"lines 197-199, 249-254","source_type":"official","source_confidence":"high","source_confidence_reason":"Official government summary of implementation problems and corrective instructions, directly tied to 2022 performance.","final_evidence_use":"final_evidence","period_fit":"Summarizes 2022 execution and late-year bottlenecks.","ruler_attribution":"Indirect. It reflects party-state implementation under Trọng's leadership, but the source attributes the operational details to the government system, not to him personally.","contrary_evidence":["The same report also describes recovery, improved living standards, and anti-corruption gains.","It is a mixed implementation record rather than a total failure."],"lenses":["8B.6","8B.8","8B.10"]}
SOURCE_CLAIM_JSON: {"title":"Party leader presides over national conference to review 10 years of anti-corruption","publisher":"Government of Viet Nam (Government News)","publication_date":"2022-06-30","url":"https://en.baochinhphu.vn/party-leader-presides-over-national-conference-to-review-10-years-anti-corruption-111220630102207986.htm","claim":"At the decade review, the steering committee said more than 2,700 Party organizations and nearly 168,000 members had been disciplined over graft, with 19,546 corruption cases prosecuted and VND 61 trillion recovered.","locator":"lines 166-172","source_type":"official","source_confidence":"high","source_confidence_reason":"Official conference summary with concrete aggregate enforcement and recovery figures.","final_evidence_use":"context","period_fit":"Spans the decade but was presented in 2022 as the operating anti-corruption program's result.","ruler_attribution":"Indirect but meaningful. The figures reflect the anti-corruption apparatus under Trọng's leadership, though not a personal action log.","contrary_evidence":["The numbers reflect system-wide enforcement, not necessarily clean governance everywhere.","The conference is retrospective and aggregate, not a single 2022 intervention."],"lenses":["8B.3","8B.5","8B.6","8B.10"]}
SOURCE_CLAIM_JSON: {"title":"Party chief chairs anti-corruption meeting","publisher":"Government News","publication_date":"2022-08-17","url":"https://en.baochinhphu.vn/party-chief-chairs-anti-corruption-meeting-111220817162948058.htm","claim":"Trong ordered stronger asset and income controls, review of loopholes in bidding, auction, finance, land use, and public property, and faster completion of 16 investigations, 39 verifications, 20 prosecutions, and 22 first-instance trials.","locator":"lines 166-171","source_type":"official","source_confidence":"high","source_confidence_reason":"Direct official report of a Trọng-chaired meeting with specific tasks and case-processing targets.","final_evidence_use":"final_evidence","period_fit":"Directly in 2022.","ruler_attribution":"Direct. Trọng chaired the committee and set the specific anti-corruption follow-through agenda.","contrary_evidence":["The meeting shows control and enforcement, not necessarily overall policy success.","It may also reflect political discipline rather than neutral administrative capacity."],"lenses":["8B.2","8B.3","8B.5","8B.6","8B.8"]}
SOURCE_CLAIM_JSON: {"title":"Thanh tra, Kiểm toán kiến nghị xử lý, thu hồi hơn 200 nghìn tỷ đồng","publisher":"Báo Điện tử Chính phủ","publication_date":"2022-10-19","url":"https://baochinhphu.vn/thanh-tra-kiem-toan-kien-nghi-xu-ly-thu-hoi-hon-300-nghin-ty-dong-102221019174422729.htm","claim":"The 2022 anti-corruption implementation report said 52,716 officials were rotated, 7,662 asset declarations were verified, 74 declarations were found noncompliant and corrected, and 19 heads were disciplined for failing to prevent corruption.","locator":"lines 194-199","source_type":"official","source_confidence":"high","source_confidence_reason":"Official government report with concrete operational metrics on enforcement, verification, and accountability.","final_evidence_use":"final_evidence","period_fit":"Directly in 2022.","ruler_attribution":"Indirect but substantial. This is party-state anti-corruption administration under Trọng's leadership, though not a personal ethics record.","contrary_evidence":["The figures also show compliance problems remained significant.","The report does not prove personal integrity, only system enforcement."],"lenses":["8B.5","8B.6","8B.8","8B.10"]}
SOURCE_CLAIM_JSON: {"title":"Vietnam arrests former coast guard chief over 'embezzlement' case","publisher":"Reuters via Euronews","publication_date":"2022-04-19","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2022/04/19/us-vietnam-security-arrests","claim":"Reuters reported that Vietnam detained a former coast guard commander and six other senior officers on suspicion of embezzlement as the ruling party intensified its graft crackdown.","locator":"lines 658-670","source_type":"media","source_confidence":"high","source_confidence_reason":"Reuters reporting on a concrete enforcement action against senior officials; strong for the arrest and case context.","final_evidence_use":"final_evidence","period_fit":"Directly in 2022.","ruler_attribution":"Indirect. The case unfolded under the anti-corruption drive associated with Trọng, but the report does not show his personal action or intent beyond the campaign context.","contrary_evidence":["This is enforcement against others, not evidence of Trọng's own misconduct.","It can be read as clean-up or factional discipline, not personal competence alone."],"lenses":["8B.3","8B.5","8B.8"]}
SOURCE_CLAIM_JSON: {"title":"Viet Nam, China issue joint statement","publisher":"Government News","publication_date":"2022-11-02","url":"https://en.baochinhphu.vn/viet-nam-china-issue-joint-statement-11122110208592351.htm","claim":"The joint statement said Viet Nam and China would implement the 2021-2025 cooperation plan and the 2021-2025 personnel-training plan, deepen coordination between party external-relations agencies, and strengthen diplomacy, defense, security, and law-enforcement cooperation.","locator":"lines 190-198","source_type":"official","source_confidence":"high","source_confidence_reason":"Official joint statement with specific implementation mechanisms and personnel/cooperation commitments.","final_evidence_use":"final_evidence","period_fit":"Directly in 2022.","ruler_attribution":"Direct enough for foreign-policy execution. The visit was Trọng's official trip, and the commitments were made under his authority as CPV chief.","contrary_evidence":["The statement is cooperative and aspirational, not a performance audit.","It does not by itself quantify outcomes from the cooperation plans."],"lenses":["8B.3","8B.4","8B.5","8B.9","8B.10"]}
SOURCE_CLAIM_JSON: {"title":"Vietnam 2022 GDP growth quickens to 8.02%, fastest since 1997","publisher":"Reuters via Investing.com","publication_date":"2022-12-28","url":"https://www.investing.com/news/economic-indicators/vietnam-2022-gdp-growth-quickens-to-802-vs-258-expansion-in-2021-2970866","claim":"Vietnam's economy grew 8.02% in 2022, the fastest annual pace since 1997, with services up 9.99%, industry and construction up 7.78%, and agriculture up 3.36%.","locator":"Reuters article lead and sector breakdown","source_type":"media","source_confidence":"high","source_confidence_reason":"Reuters wire report on official 2022 GDP statistics; strong for outcome direction despite external headwinds.","final_evidence_use":"final_evidence","period_fit":"Directly in 2022.","ruler_attribution":"Indirect but important. The outcome is part of the 2022 policy record under Trọng, but it also reflects external demand, reopening, and inherited reforms.","contrary_evidence":["The same report notes global slowdown headwinds and prior pandemic damage.","GDP growth alone does not prove effective implementation of every program component."],"lenses":["8B.7","8B.10"]}
SOURCE_CLAIM_JSON: {"title":"Consumer price index, gold and USD price indexes, December 2022","publisher":"National Statistics Office of Vietnam","publication_date":"2022-12-29","url":"https://www.nso.gov.vn/en/data-and-statistics/2022/12/consumer-price-index-gold-and-usd-price-indexes-december-2022/","claim":"Vietnam's CPI increased 3.15% in 2022, reaching the National Assembly target, while core inflation was lower than headline CPI.","locator":"first paragraph and CPI summary sections","source_type":"official","source_confidence":"high","source_confidence_reason":"Official statistical release with precise annual inflation figures and target comparison.","final_evidence_use":"final_evidence","period_fit":"Directly in 2022.","ruler_attribution":"Indirect. It is a system outcome under the 2022 program, not a personal action trace, but it is relevant to competence.","contrary_evidence":["The same release notes strong inflationary pressures and fuel-price effects.","Target attainment does not by itself establish broader policy success."],"lenses":["8B.7","8B.10"]}
SOURCE_CLAIM_JSON: {"title":"FDI disbursement sets new record in 2022","publisher":"Government News","publication_date":"2022-12-27","url":"https://en.baochinhphu.vn/fdi-disbursement-sets-new-record-in-2022-11122122710330533.htm","claim":"Vietnam's realized foreign direct investment reached US$22.4 billion in 2022, up 13.5% year on year, with total FDI pledges also reported for the year.","locator":"lead paragraph and FDI figures section","source_type":"official","source_confidence":"high","source_confidence_reason":"Official government report citing MPI data and giving precise investment figures.","final_evidence_use":"final_evidence","period_fit":"Directly in 2022.","ruler_attribution":"Indirect. It reflects the investment climate under the 2022 program, though not Trọng's personal hand on every inflow.","contrary_evidence":["Pledges fell even as realized FDI rose.","FDI is only one component of the program outcome."],"lenses":["8B.7","8B.10"]}
SOURCE_CLAIM_JSON: {"title":"Disbursement of economic recovery package remains slow","publisher":"Government News","publication_date":"2022-09-06","url":"https://en.baochinhphu.vn/disbursement-of-economic-recovery-package-remains-slow-111220906161443877.htm","claim":"By January-August 2022, only VND55.5 trillion of the VND350 trillion recovery package had been disbursed, and officials said procedures and weak local initiative were slowing implementation.","locator":"lead paragraphs and disbursement breakdown","source_type":"official","source_confidence":"high","source_confidence_reason":"Official government update with exact disbursement figures and explicit implementation bottleneck diagnosis.","final_evidence_use":"final_evidence","period_fit":"Directly in 2022.","ruler_attribution":"Indirect but important. It reflects execution under the party-state led by Trọng; the delay is mainly an implementation and coordination problem rather than a single-person act.","contrary_evidence":["The same report shows substantial funds were already moving through social support and tax-relief channels.","It indicates a real but incomplete rollout, not total failure."],"lenses":["8B.6","8B.8","8B.10"]}

**Search and rejection summary**
I screened roughly 25-40 documents across Government News, the national government portal, the National Statistics Office, Reuters syndications, the IMF/World Bank trail, VietnamPlus/VietnamNews, and a few local-language pages. I kept the sources that best showed a chain from stated program to budgets, coordination, implementation, outcomes, and bottlenecks.

Rejected or de-prioritized:
- Generic macro pages that repeated the same GDP or inflation figures without adding ruler-specific implementation context.
- Duplicate reprints of the same anti-corruption meeting or the same Reuters wire story on multiple syndication sites.
- Purely moral, rights, or corruption-trend material when it did not help the 8B execution chain.
- Out-of-period retrospectives and 2024-2026 follow-ups that were not needed to reconstruct 2022 execution.
- Blocked or timeout pages when an official snippet or alternate source already gave the same claim.
- Pages that only showed Trọng's title or office without a program, implementation, or outcome link.

**Remaining gaps**
- The strongest evidence is still mostly program-and-institution level. There is less direct proof of Trọng personally managing day-to-day implementation beyond chairing the central committee and setting strategic direction.
- Foreign-policy execution is better evidenced than domestic administrative execution, but even there the record is mostly coordination and commitments rather than outcome audits.
- More search would help if you want sharper evidence on whether the 2022 recovery package and anti-corruption drive materially changed subnational delivery, not just central targets and aggregate outcomes.
- I did not find a clean, ruler-specific audit of personnel replacements or a detailed before/after comparison showing which implementers were promoted or removed because of performance.
